              "text": "FEDERAL RESERVE statistical release G.17 (419) For release at 9:15 a.m. (EDT) October 16, 2026 INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION AND CAP ACITY UTILIZATION Industrial production (IP) increased 0.7 percent in Septem ber after edging up 0.1 percent in August. In the third quarter, IP increased at an annual rate of 2.8 perce nt. Manufacturing output rose 0.3 percent in September. The index for mining moved up 0.2 percent, and the index for utilities increased 3.5 percent. At (over) Industrial Production and Capacity Utilization: Summary Seasonally adjusted 2017=100 Percent change 2026 2026 Sept. ’25 to Industrial production Apr.r Mayr Juner Julyr Aug.r Sept.p Apr.r Mayr Juner Julyr Aug.r Sept.p Sept. ’26 Total index 102.6 102.7 103.0 103.2 103.3 104.0 .8 .1 .2 .2 .1 .7 2.2 Previous estimates 102.6 102.6",
